   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting a More Resilient Arts + Culture Sector</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Houston Arts Alliance is a local arts and culture organization whose principal work is to implement the City of Houston&apos;s vision, values, and goals for its arts grantmaking and civic art investments. HAA also executes privately funded projects to meet the needs of the arts community, such as disaster preparation, equity in the arts and arts education, research on the state of the arts in Houston, and temporary public art projects.  HAA helps artists and nonprofits be bold, productive and strong.</narrative>
  </description>
